== Mk-tier ladder mapping ==
The Psi Defender preset is the '''third'''
Psi-Tech preset to ship. Per the 7-step Mk-ladder canonical
taxonomy:

* '''[[HelmKit Mk2.0]]''' — Defender preset slot exercised. The
  Mk2.0 ambient EM dosimeter (RF survey channel) feeds a
  counter-field or alerting logic. This is the first tier where
  Defender has the input substrate (ambient EM monitoring) it
  requires.
* '''[[HelmKit Mk2.5]]''' — Defender continues to run on all
  three arms (H1 / H2 / sham) of the matched-F² G3 RCT.
* '''[[HelmKit Mk3.0]]''' — Defender becomes
  '''cross-unit''': cross-wearer threat-channel awareness.

The Defender preset's MCU-B blacklist enforcement is the strictest
of the three triad presets; see [[HelmKit Architecture#Safety
blacklist|safety blacklist]].

